{"id":"n73489-1-7","stage":5,"title":"잡화 · 杂货","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73489-1-7-1","ko":"구두 사려면 어디로 가야 해요?","zh":"买皮鞋要去哪里？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"구두","meaning":"皮鞋","explanation":"구두：皮鞋","readings":[{"term":"구두","audio":"/audio/0053d9a2905615031142.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26805","senseId":"1","lemma":"구두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구두","audio":"/audio/0053d9a2905615031142.mp3"}},{"text":"사려면","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사려면","audio":"/audio/919dbd6322976cde45ef.mp3"}},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디로","audio":"/audio/0fbbfd5af1ab3c98e173.mp3"}},{"text":"가야","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가야","audio":"/audio/6aca1779d1b3c7fc08b4.mp3"}},{"text":"해요?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0053d9a290561503","term":"구두","zh":"皮鞋","audio":"/audio/0053d9a2905615031142.mp3","entryId":"26805","definition":"穿正装时所穿的由皮革、塑料等制成的鞋。","pronunciation":